# English only

`fb-sdk` is the public demo repository.

- Commit messages are English. One or two sentences, focused on why.
- Code comments are English, including CMake comments.
- User-facing locale strings stay in their language. Chinese copy in `L10n` / `i18n` is the product UI, not a comment.

Do not apply this to `fb`. Engine commits stay in Chinese.
